  "description": "Own any ground! If the best and strongest is the only thing that is good enough for you, then our brand-new HYBE 10.5 is just right. This “Power Sports” eFully offers the ideal mix of speed, integration and performance and rolls like a world champion even on rough terrain. On the uphill, the new Yamaha PW-XM motor fulfils your every drive wish. On the downhill, you’ll be riding in maximum comfort with 170mm travel at the fork and 160mm travel at the rear, while the Magura MT7 disc brakes bring you to a stop quickly at all times. Smooth: the mullet setup with 29″ front and 27.5″ rear offers you the best of both worlds and thus performance on any terrain. And with the Sram GX Eagle AXS groupset, you’ll always find the right gear. As we said: you definitely don’t need to compromise with our new HYBE 10.5 – no matter what terrain you’re riding on.",
